{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seth Slays Everybody</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A roguelike tower defense where you play as a god trapped in a guillotine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seth, the god of chaos, has been captured by Horus and is now stuck inside a sacred guillotine in the middle of the desert. But that won\u2019t stop him from destroying everyone! Use deadly traps, divine powers, and cursed relics to wipe out wave after wave of Horus\u2019 minions \u2014 and turn the desert sands into a sea of blood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic <strong>Plants vs Zombies</strong> style with a roguelike progression system where every run is different. Create insane builds focused on Seth\u2019s powers, Egyptian traps, or cursed treasures. Advance through a <strong>Slay the Spire\u2013style map</strong>, survive brutal encounters, reach Horus\u2026 kick his ass, and reclaim your divine body!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of unique traps and enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix Egyptian traps, Seth\u2019s powers, and cursed relics to create ridiculous builds while facing soldiers, divine creatures, and monsters sent by Horus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost? Then Horus kicks your ass.</strong><br>And you come back\u2026 even angrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More content coming</strong>New traps, enemies, bosses, and gameplay systems are planned for future updates!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840370?t=1773458479","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840370/a084f67f23d6a7e3b77c9b97803c00f6c58ec0fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773458479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840370/8a24089dd1edc579f84eec0c10e4f0b0b9fcd095/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773458479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass